# Generated knowledge-graph output (`/graphify`). Derived from the corpus and
# regenerated on demand — graph.json, graph.html and GRAPH_REPORT.md together
# run to ~2 MB.
#
# NOT committed, deliberately. A checked-in copy would go stale the moment any
# governed document changed, with nothing in this repository able to notice —
# which is the failure class already registered as C-71 (a posture statement
# outliving the state it described) and C-76 (front-page claims nothing checked).
# Committing it would manufacture a fresh instance of the thing this repo keeps
# registering. If it is ever wanted durably it needs a regeneration trigger and
# a staleness marker first, not a commit.
graphify-out/
